        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-04-21T19:33:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint 7/14/8/11. An easy game, as long as you are precise. Also easy for an inattentive player to KO her on her second turn. A late game Vivid Thoughts is also ill-advised.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Legacy set things up for Stuntman. Moving Target and Lead from the Front/Heroic Interception is a powerful combo. Idealist played cleanup, and Cosmic was... there, adding +1 to H.</p>",
