      {
        "id": 230335,
        "name": "redsweater",
        "username": "redsweater",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/f04885/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-04-23T01:41:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint 5/10/6/6. Took it slow and deliberate, taking more damage than necessary to avoid dealing any damage at all to the Dreamer. This was my first game with Stuntman, and he stole the show with Lance-Flammes and a lot of out-of-turn actions. Turns out stacking&nbsp;All My Own Stunts multiple times when things are already dead/handled makes the next round so much&nbsp;easier, if you can trigger another power before his turn starts.</p>",
